Derivation
----------
DoppelBee is a modified work derived from DuoBreak:

    DuoBreak — https://github.com/JesseNaser/DuoBreak
    Copyright (C) 2023 Jesse Naser
    Licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later

What was derived: the Duo activation protocol implementation (device
enrollment and iOS device emulation, RSA SHA-512 signed push
authentication, transaction handling) and the HOTP secret handling
(base32 encoding of activation secrets), reimplemented in Swift from the
original Python implementation.

Date of modification (AGPL section 5(a)): DoppelBee was developed from
DuoBreak beginning 2026-01-04 and has been modified continuously since.
This notice was recorded on 2026-08-18 and updated on 2026-09-19.

Former name
-----------
This work was published as "DuoBee" for releases 1.0.0 through 2.0.1. It
was renamed to "DoppelBee" effective from version 3.0.0 to avoid any
suggestion of affiliation with Duo Security, Inc. or Cisco Systems, Inc.
Only the name changed; the copyright holder, the derivation from
DuoBreak, and the AGPL-3.0-or-later license are unaffected.

